  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advocacy Leadership Empowerment for Women,Youth and National Coordinators for Communication</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Africa continues to experience periods of conflict and political instability. Addressing the root causes and building a foundation for lasting peace requires a comprehensive approach that involves all segments of the society. Engaging the Laity, the National Directors of Communication, the Youth and the Women Leaders is essential as they represent the majority of the population. Their active involvement is crucial for sustainable peace, development. This project therefore seeks to put in place ambassadors of peace to address specific needs and opportunities within these groups, recognizing their unique roles in shaping community dynamics and effective transmission of news and current affairs in the different conferences and countries of West Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
